You stick on 17. The house rule is that the dealer must twist below 17, so the dealer turns over 5 and Q for 15 and twists. The dealer draws the 3 of hearts for 18.

Dealer wins with 18 against your 17, and you lose your 100 stake. Your chips stay at 900.

